menu "cpptaskcreate"

    config CPPTASKCREATE_TLS_INDEX
        int "Thread local storage pointer index of the task callable"
        range 1 15
        default 1
        help
            FreeRTOS thread local storage pointer index at which
            cppTaskCreate() registers each task's callable, so that FreeRTOS
            can free it when the task is deleted. Index 0 is reserved by
            ESP-IDF for the pthreads API (the C++ exception machinery reads
            it), so it cannot be used. Raise this value if index 1 is already
            taken by another component: two components that share an index
            silently overwrite each other's pointer and deletion callback.
            The value must stay below
            CONFIG_FREERTOS_THREAD_LOCAL_STORAGE_POINTERS.

endmenu
